If you are a Dankookian (students of Dankook University), then you must know about the festival Danfesta, held every spring. During this period, there are often weather problems to overcome[.] Last[ year, with] gloomy forecasts predicted, many Dankookians feared the festival would[ be] canceled. While it[ wasn]’t totally canceled[,] a[ lot] of events were abandoned or altered for the safety of the students[ due to] the[ inc]lement weather[.]
